      "comment": "Ptashka: Tonia and Teucer",
      "content": "The Traveler first approaches her because Tartaglia asked them to look for his sister Tonia, who had tickets. Ptashka accepts the name. The deception unravels when the Traveler asks how Teucer is and says her brother Ajax must have mentioned them; she is puzzled and says her brother's name is Razyk. She then explains that Tonia was a character in a storybook she and her brother read, and that she thought it was a secret name her brother chose.",
