      "comment": "Ptashka: Chugunov and Iskra",
      "content": "The merchant's daughter Iskra died of Frostblight at six, the year before a cure was announced. When \"Tonia\" mentioned her brother's Frostfairy Flower medicine, Chugunov worked out she belonged to an earlier era, kept quiet and vouched for her. Ptashka tells him, kindly and firmly, that the people he owes apologies to are those who died.",
