      "comment": "Ptashka: Ronova's Curse of Death in the theater",
      "content": "Ronova, disguised as Alyosha, tells the group they are under her Curse of Death: two die each night as she ferries souls, a limit tied to the angels' renovation of the theater's Ley Lines. Mitya reasons that the nightly toll matches the number of the dead present; it drops to one after Shram leaves.",
